1
00:04:06,923 --> 00:04:12,923
For Harry and Lloyd, every day is a no-brainer.

2
00:08:13,846 --> 00:08:19,846
Dumb and Dumber is a comedy film directed by Peter Farrelly.

3
00:12:20,769 --> 00:12:26,769
Lloyd and Harry are two men whose stupidity is really indescribable.

4
00:16:27,692 --> 00:16:33,692
When Mary, a beautiful woman, loses an important suitcase with money before she leaves for
Aspen, the two friends (who have found the suitcase) decide to return it to her.

5
00:20:34,615 --> 00:20:40,615
After some "adventures" they finally get to Aspen where, using the
lost money they live it up and fight for Mary's heart.

6
00:24:41,538 --> 00:24:47,538
Lloyd Christmas, played by Jim Carrey.

7
00:28:48,461 --> 00:28:54,461
Harry Dunne, played by Jeff Daniels.

8
00:32:55,384 --> 00:33:01,384
Mary Swanson, played by Lauren Holly.

9
00:37:02,307 --> 00:37:08,307
Helen Swanson, played by Teri Garr.

10
00:41:09,230 --> 00:41:15,230
Nicholas Andre, played by Charles Rocket.

11
00:45:16,153 --> 00:45:22,153
J.P. Shay, played by Karen Duffy.

12
00:49:23,076 --> 00:49:29,076
Dumb and Dumber To is a 2014 American buddy comedy film produced,
co-written and directed by the Farrelly brothers.

13
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:36,000
It is the third film in the Dumb and Dumber franchise, and
serves as a sequel to the 1994 film Dumb and Dumber.

14
00:57:36,923 --> 00:57:42,923
The film stars Jim Carrey and Jeff Daniels as Lloyd Christmas and Harry Dunne, reprising their respective roles 20 years after the events of the first film, and follows the duo as
they discover Harry has a daughter, who was set up for adoption as a baby by her single mother, leading them to journey on a cross-country road trip to locate her.

15
01:01:43,846 --> 01:01:49,846
First announced in October 2011, Dumb and Dumber To underwent a turbulent pre-production phase
which included, at one point, Carrey withdrawing from the project, and Warner Bros.

16
01:05:50,769 --> 01:05:56,769
Pictures exiting the project; Warner Bros.'s New Line Cinema division received
"in association with" credit, per their participation stake.

17
01:09:57,692 --> 01:10:03,692
The project was eventually taken on in 2013 by Red Granite
Pictures and the film was shot later that year.

18
01:14:04,615 --> 01:14:10,615
Released on November 14, 2014, by Universal Pictures, the
film received negative reviews from critics.

19
01:18:11,538 --> 01:18:17,538
It grossed $36.1 million on its opening weekend and over $169 million worldwide.

20
01:22:18,461 --> 01:22:24,461
On June 15, 2017, the United States Department of Justice charged that money used to
produce the film was stolen from a Malaysian government investment fund.

21
01:26:25,384 --> 01:26:31,384
Red Granite Pictures denied knowingly accepting stolen money.

22
01:30:32,307 --> 01:30:38,307
Prosecutors also filed a Forfeiture Complaint in federal court to seize the rights of
ownership to Dumb and Dumber To as well as the rights to the 2015 film Daddy's Home.

23
01:34:39,230 --> 01:34:45,230
Red Granite later made a $60 million settlement.

24
01:38:46,153 --> 01:38:52,153
The film explores themes of gas station, utah, motel, stupidity, cigar smoking.

25
01:42:53,076 --> 01:42:59,076
The tone is lighthearted.
